{
  "id": "compound.consumable_rest_loop",
  "name": "Consumables, Rest & Recovery Loop",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "A replay-safe RPG recovery loop: Potion Belt accepts or rejects a use before touching the shared inventory stack, starts generated shared cooldowns, and routes health, generic resource, status, and cleanse requests to their sole owners. Rest Camp owns safe-zone/combat eligibility, one pending rest, persisted risk, interruption, and completion. Only completed rest recovers health, named resources, and prepared casts; ambushes use the existing encounter spawner. Stable use, rest, recovery, application, and cleanse ids plus timer generations make reloads and stale completions inert. Original Glimmerfen content is host-replaceable.",
  "targetPlatform": "agnostic",
